1
00:00:42,439 --> 00:00:43,880
Brother Camel

2
00:00:44,439 --> 00:00:45,719
Wake up, wake up, wake up.

3
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:49,600
Look who's been waiting for you.

4
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,159
Cannon.

5
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:56,439
I knew it was you, Mad Dog.

6
00:00:58,679 --> 00:01:00,960
Brother Camel, how you feeling?

7
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:03,200
I've been waiting for you to wake up.

8
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,680
Go on, any last words?

9
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:07,519
I'll pass them along for you.

10
00:01:07,560 --> 00:01:09,439
Are you sick in the head?

11
00:01:09,879 --> 00:01:12,280
First you had people jump me for nothing,

12
00:01:12,439 --> 00:01:14,159
and now you're coming after me again.

13
00:01:14,280 --> 00:01:16,040
What did I ever do to you?

14
00:01:16,079 --> 00:01:17,519
You didn't do anything to me.

15
00:01:17,519 --> 00:01:19,120
You're just in my way.

16
00:01:19,200 --> 00:01:21,000
You really are a Mad Dog.

17
00:01:21,439 --> 00:01:23,319
I didn't kill your whole family.

18
00:01:23,640 --> 00:01:25,439
Yet you constantly come after me.

19
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:33,319
Brother Camel, you talk too much.

20
00:01:33,799 --> 00:01:35,040
Before this,

21
00:01:35,640 --> 00:01:38,719
we stayed out of each other's way.

22
00:01:38,719 --> 00:01:40,359
I couldn't be bothered with you.

23
00:01:41,120 --> 00:01:43,719
You really think you're the boss?

24
00:01:45,439 --> 00:01:47,359
Let me tell you the truth.

25
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:49,079
I, Cannon,

26
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:53,040
am about to be Heyisheng's Dragon Head.

27
00:01:53,040 --> 00:01:53,840
Pfft.

28
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,280
And you,

29
00:01:55,280 --> 00:01:57,120
you're just causing trouble for our gang.

30
00:01:57,159 --> 00:01:58,400
So you've got to be taken out.

31
00:01:58,400 --> 00:01:59,760
That's the condition.

32
00:02:00,359 --> 00:02:01,680
You're standing in the way of my rise,

33
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,200
so I'm going to finish you off.

34
00:02:05,400 --> 00:02:07,760
Are you all sick in the head?

35
00:02:08,719 --> 00:02:10,639
You Heyisheng guys fight for Dragon Head,

36
00:02:11,039 --> 00:02:13,400
and use me, Camel, as the prize.

37
00:02:14,280 --> 00:02:16,199
I won't accept this!

38
00:02:37,680 --> 00:02:39,680
You think killing me

39
00:02:39,919 --> 00:02:42,319
makes you the Dragon Head?

40
00:02:43,080 --> 00:02:45,080
That Xie Guanhong is ruthless.

41
00:02:46,159 --> 00:02:48,400
You think you'll hold that seat?

42
00:02:52,159 --> 00:02:53,080
What did he say?

43
00:02:53,639 --> 00:02:55,840
He said you think you'll hold that seat.

44
00:02:56,039 --> 00:02:57,680
Let me tell you,

45
00:02:59,000 --> 00:03:01,759
even if today

46
00:03:01,759 --> 00:03:03,759
Xie Guanhong were standing here,

47
00:03:03,759 --> 00:03:05,280
I'd burn him along with you.

48
00:03:05,280 --> 00:03:06,039
Light it up.

49
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:10,280
Wait!

50
00:03:11,599 --> 00:03:12,400
I'm still useful!

51
00:03:12,639 --> 00:03:13,439
I'm still useful!

52
00:03:13,840 --> 00:03:14,759
I'm still useful!

53
00:03:16,639 --> 00:03:18,879
I know who killed Brother Long 20 years ago!

54
00:03:27,000 --> 00:03:27,800
Talk.

55
00:03:28,319 --> 00:03:29,560
Who killed Brother Long?

56
00:03:40,159 --> 00:03:42,680
Cannon, my good brother.

57
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,599
Move forward, keep up.

58
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:52,639
Xie Guanhong.

59
00:03:53,520 --> 00:03:55,080
What's this? Clocking in?

60
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:56,039
No, no, no.

61
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:57,280
I'm shooting a documentary.

62
00:03:58,000 --> 00:03:59,479
I've already got a title for it.

63
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:01,840
Crime Scene.

64
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,719
Trust me, it'll win awards.

65
00:04:03,759 --> 00:04:04,360
Boss.

66
00:04:04,360 --> 00:04:05,280
Shooting short dramas makes good money.

67
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,080
There's potential in this.

68
00:04:06,159 --> 00:04:07,400
Potential my ass.

69
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,800
Get closer, show the face.

70
00:04:15,560 --> 00:04:17,000
Can't get any closer.

71
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:18,399
The face is out of frame.

72
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,959
Look at that face.

73
00:04:20,720 --> 00:04:21,920
So full of bloodlust.

74
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,519
You even went to kill Camel,

75
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,439
and ran to Uncle Fat to claim credit.

76
00:04:27,759 --> 00:04:29,360
Trying to snatch my Dragon Head seat.

77
00:04:29,879 --> 00:04:31,720
That's no loyalty, is it, Cannon?

78
00:04:32,720 --> 00:04:33,839
My God.

79
00:04:34,480 --> 00:04:35,480
Brothers.

80
00:04:37,800 --> 00:04:40,120
A guy with no rules, no honor,

81
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,519
lecturing me about loyalty.

82
00:04:41,560 --> 00:04:42,879
You hog all the goods.

83
00:04:42,879 --> 00:04:44,240
You pocket all the money.

84
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:47,360
The guys can only afford chicken wings.

85
00:04:51,199 --> 00:04:52,600
I understand how you feel.

86
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,519
But that's a separate matter.

87
00:04:57,680 --> 00:05:00,079
Beating my people, wrecking my turf,

88
00:05:00,680 --> 00:05:02,399
and secretly cozying up to Uncle Fat.

89
00:05:02,920 --> 00:05:04,600
This has nothing to do with loyalty.

90
00:05:06,439 --> 00:05:09,560
Cannon doesn't just want the Dragon Head.

91
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:12,639
He wants me dead too.

92
00:05:12,639 --> 00:05:13,720
You're damn right.

93
00:05:13,720 --> 00:05:15,319
I do want you dead.

94
00:05:15,439 --> 00:05:16,240
So what?

95
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:18,360
Don't you want me dead?

96
00:05:18,439 --> 00:05:19,639
If you don't want me dead,

97
00:05:19,639 --> 00:05:21,040
why bring all these men here?

98
00:05:21,399 --> 00:05:22,480
To shoot a short drama.

99
00:05:22,879 --> 00:05:24,240
Vertical format, too.

100
00:05:27,920 --> 00:05:29,720
I already gave you one chance.

101
00:05:29,959 --> 00:05:31,040
Make the most of it.

102
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:36,480
What chance?

103
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:38,639
To be your dogs?

104
00:05:42,000 --> 00:05:44,000
His head really needs examining.

105
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,959
He can't understand a word I'm saying.

106
00:05:48,240 --> 00:05:49,040
Sorry.

107
00:05:50,399 --> 00:05:51,560
I'm dead serious.

108
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:53,120
Fine.

109
00:05:53,399 --> 00:05:55,879
I'll let you shoot a smash hit.

110
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:12,839
You knew I killed Brother Long.

111
00:08:23,759 --> 00:08:25,399
Why did you hide it for 20 years?

112
00:08:38,799 --> 00:08:40,440
Thanks.

113
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:07,519
What are you doing here?

114
00:09:22,600 --> 00:09:23,720
Get out of the way.

115
00:09:27,759 --> 00:09:28,879
Don't get your hands dirty.

116
00:10:39,480 --> 00:10:40,600
You don't know how to cook.

117
00:10:40,919 --> 00:10:42,519
You don't know that firing up the wok,

118
00:10:42,519 --> 00:10:43,720
the smoke is the most choking.

119
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:46,879
Step back a bit.

120
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:06,080
Dad.

121
00:11:08,039 --> 00:11:09,360
Someone's been killed!

122
00:11:17,120 --> 00:11:19,240
Your mom wanted you away from all this.

123
00:11:21,360 --> 00:11:22,919
I think she had a point.

124
00:11:24,840 --> 00:11:26,320
So for the first twenty years,

125
00:11:27,279 --> 00:11:29,639
your mom and I kept you well protected.

126
00:11:36,559 --> 00:11:37,679
But it can't be helped.

127
00:11:39,360 --> 00:11:40,320
The blood in your veins

128
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:42,159
is the blood of Xie Guanhong.

129
00:11:45,799 --> 00:11:47,440
I always knew this day would come.

130
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:59,039
That's normal.

131
00:12:01,559 --> 00:12:02,480
You'll get used to it.

132
00:12:09,639 --> 00:12:11,399
This is reality.
